  "id": "pr-277",
  "instruction": "Add support for TOML format targets when executing glom transformations from the command-line interface (CLI).\n\nRequirements:\n- The CLI should support loading and querying TOML target data from files or standard input, consistent with existing format options (such as JSON, YAML, and Python literal formats).\n- Add CLI options/flags to specify TOML input formatting.\n- For parsing TOML data, use Python's built-in `tomllib` on Python 3.11+, falling back to `tomli` on earlier Python versions.\n- Proper error handling and usage messages should be provided when invalid format options, invalid TOML data, or missing parsing dependencies are encountered.",
